            <h3>Select Boxes in desktop, Citrix, SAP and mobile apps automation</h3>

            <p>
                The Selenium IDE select command works only for standard select boxes. It does not work for select boxes in desktop apps. Also, some modern
                web apps might be have select box-style elements that look like a HTML select box, but technically is custom Javascript
                (<a href="https://forum.ocr.space/t/how-to-automate-a-custom-select-box-visually-with-ocr/7015">Example</a>). In all these cases
                you can use <a href="https://forum.ocr.space/t/how-to-automate-a-custom-select-box-visually-with-ocr/7015">visual select box automation</a>.
            </p>

